      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "9VxTpVEt7pfqeLL50rQhz",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785467737549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n\n-> User can join / leave a group\n-> User can add expense in a group\n-> Adding expense should be based on several strategies\n(Equal Split, % Split, Exact Split)\n-> User can't leave group without settling expenses\n-> User can also add individual expenses outside group (one-on-one)\n-> A notification to be sent when an expense is added/settled ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n\n-> User can join / leave a group\n-> User can add expense in a group\n-> Adding expense should be based on several strategies\n(Equal Split, % Split, Exact Split)\n-> User can't leave group without settling expenses\n-> User can also add individual expenses outside group (one-on-one)\n-> A notification to be sent when an expense is added/settled ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
