      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785473175294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 transaction will be needed to complete all transaction\n\n\nAditya's gain/loss after all transactions: +400\nManish's gain/loss after all transactions: +200\nRohit's gain/loss after all transactions: -200\nSourav's gain/loss after all transactions: -400\n\nDebtors: Rohit, Saurav\nCreditors: Aditya, Manish\n\n-> we will sort both these lists in desc order\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3 transaction will be needed to complete all transaction\n\n\nAditya's gain/loss after all transactions: +400\nManish's gain/loss after all transactions: +200\nRohit's gain/loss after all transactions: -200\nSourav's gain/loss after all transactions: -400\n\nDebtors: Rohit, Saurav\nCreditors: Aditya, Manish\n\n-> we will sort both these lists in desc order\n",
